{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the beginning of an epic survival journey in this free demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A failed experiment has left the world in ruins, mutated, eerie and crawling with relentless zombies. Fight your way through atmospheric locations like abandoned cities and dark swamps using an arsenal of guns, melee weapons and grenades to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the first three missions of the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect weapons, find ammo and kill anything on your way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683650/extras/JTU_GIF_1.gif?t=1745768348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw grenades and shoot explosive barrels to take down zombies in thrilling combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use health kits and food to stay fit and ready for the next fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">State-of-the-art technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in photorealistic graphics with cinema-quality models and textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience realistic real-time lighting for a visually stunning world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch off the HUD entirely by pressing TAB for a more immersive experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683650?t=1745768348","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683650?t=1745768348","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683650/fc3a5c2a845d7283d802ee36355a0f3bf0edee8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745768348","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683650/fc3a5c2a845d7283d802ee36355a0f3bf0edee8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745768348","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the beginning of an epic survival journey in this free demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A failed experiment has left the world in ruins, mutated, eerie and crawling with relentless zombies. Fight your way through atmospheric locations like abandoned cities and dark swamps using an arsenal of guns, melee weapons and grenades to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the first three missions of the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect weapons, find ammo and kill anything on your way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683650/extras/JTU_GIF_1.gif?t=1745768348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw grenades and shoot explosive barrels to take down zombies in thrilling combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use health kits and food to stay fit and ready for the next fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">State-of-the-art technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in photorealistic graphics with cinema-quality models and textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience realistic real-time lighting for a visually stunning world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch off the HUD entirely by pressing TAB for a more immersive experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dazzling Divine"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3532280","name":"Journey Through the Undead"},"genres":[{"descrip